rted"><!----><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c495075947="" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="spinner spinner-border ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c495075947="" class="sr-only">Carregando...</span></div><!----></ds-base-loading><!----></ds-loading></div></div></div><!----><img _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="thumbnail-content img-fluid d-none ng-star-inserted" src="" alt="Imagem de Miniatura"><!----><!----></div></ds-base-thumbnail><!----></ds-thumbnail></a><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="col-9"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="d-flex"><ds-badges _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="ng-star-inserted" data-used-theme="base"><ds-base-badges _nghost-dspace-angular-c686605257="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ds-status-badge _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c686605257="" data-used-theme="base"><ds-base-status-badge class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></ds-base-status-badge><!----></ds-status-badge><!----><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c686605257=""><ds-type-badge _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c686605257="" class="pr-1" data-used-theme="ufmg"><ds-base-type-badge class="ng-star-inserted"><span class="ng-star-inserted"><span class="badge badge-info"><span class="sr-only">Item type:</span>Dissertação de mestrado<!----><!----><!----><span class="sr-only">, </span></span></span><!----></ds-base-type-badge><!----></ds-type-badge><ds-access-status-badge _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c686605257="" class="ng-star-inserted" data-used-theme="base"><ds-base-access-status-badge _nghost-dspace-angular-c4161845445="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></ds-base-access-status-badge><!----></ds-access-status-badge><!----><!----></div></ds-base-badges><!----></ds-badges><!----></div><ds-truncatable _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" _nghost-dspace-angular-c571785846="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c571785846=""><a _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" role="link" tabindex="0" class="lead item-list-title dont-break-out ng-star-inserted" href="/items/b5310d06-b72f-464e-951a-36515b990ffd" target="_self">Otimização multiobjetivo para a manutenção seletiva de sistemas de monitoramento geotécnico</a><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="text-muted"><ds-truncatable-part _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" _nghost-dspace-angular-c2660396069=""><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="clamp-default-1 min-1"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="content dont-break-out preserve-line-breaks removeFaded"> (<span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="item-list-publisher ng-star-inserted">Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais</span><!----><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="ng-star-inserted">, </span><!----><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="item-list-date ng-star-inserted">2026-08-28</span><!---->) <!----><!----><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="item-list-authors ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="">Giovanna Cristina da Rocha</span><!----></span><!----></span><!----></div><button _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" dsdragclick="" role="button" tabindex="0" class="btn btn-link expandButton p-0" aria-expanded="false"><i _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="fa-angle-down fas"></i><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="ml-1">Mostrar mais</span></button></div></ds-truncatable-part></span><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="item-list-abstract ng-star-inserted"><ds-truncatable-part _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" _nghost-dspace-angular-c2660396069=""><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="clamp-default-3 min-3"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="content dont-break-out preserve-line-breaks removeFaded"><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="">Maintenance activities play a key role in ensuring the reliability and availability of critical systems, particularly in geotechnical monitoring contexts, where asset failures may compromise operational and environmental safety. This work proposes a multi-objective optimization approach for defining maintenance strategies for geotechnical monitoring systems, considering both the maximization of system reliability and the minimization of associated maintenance costs. Initially, historical failure data from different operational complexes were analyzed, enabling the characterization of failure modes and the adjustment of the Weibull distribution to model time-to-failure of system components. The results indicate a predominance of early-life failures, associated with shape parameters lower than one, suggesting a higher failure rate during the initial stages of operation. Based on this reliability model, a multi-objective optimization problem was formulated, integrating preventive and corrective maintenance decisions, intervention levels, technician allocation, and operational constraints such as time and resource availability. The problem was solved using the NSGA-II evolutionary algorithm, which generates a set of non-dominated solutions representing the trade-off between cost and reliability. The results demonstrate the effectiveness of the proposed approach in identifying efficient maintenance strategies, showing that selective maintenance estrategies focused on critical components can achieve high reliability levels while keeping costs under control. The analysis of the estimated Pareto frontier provides a clear understanding of the trade-offs involved in decision-making, highlighting diminishing returns in reliability gains as maintenance investments increase. It is concluded that the integration of probabilistic reliability modeling and multi-objective optimization techniques represents a valuable tool for maintenance planning in critical systems, supporting more efficient, consistent, and operationally aligned decision-making.</span></div><button _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" dsdragclick="" role="button" tabindex="0" class="btn btn-link expandButton p-0" aria-expanded="false"><i _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="fa-angle-down fas"></i><span _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c2660396069="" class="ml-1">Mostrar mais</span></button></div></ds-truncatable-part></div><!----></div></ds-truncatable><!----></div></div></ds-item-search-result-list-element><!----></ds-listable-object-component-loader></ds-item-list-element><!----></ds-listable-object-component-loader></li><li _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1672724769="" class="my-4 ng-tns-c1672724769-4 ng-star-inserted" style=""><ds-listable-object-component-loader _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1672724769="" class="pb-4 ng-tns-c1672724769-4" _nghost-dspace-angular-c46866287=""><ds-item-list-element _nghost-dspace-angular-c507007767="" class="ng-star-inserted"><ds-listable-object-component-loader _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c507007767="" _nghost-dspace-angular-c46866287=""><ds-item-search-result-list-element _nghost-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="row"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" class="col-3 col-md-2 ng-star-inserted"><a _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" role="link" tabindex="-1" class="dont-break-out ng-star-inserted" href="/items/404680c0-dec0-4980-998a-9d47c3df2a0e" target="_self"><ds-thumbnail _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1108392464="" data-used-theme="base"><ds-base-thumbnail _nghost-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="thumbnail limit-width"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="thumbnail-content outer ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="inner"><div _ngcontent-dspace-angular-c1667198364="" class="centered"><ds-loading _ngcontent-ds